#: config.html.twig
msgid ""
"When enabled, Domain Manager refuses to push any DNS record change (create/"
"update/delete/restore) to any provider. Reads and sync are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"When enabled, Domain Manager refuses to push any DNS record change (create/"
"update/delete/restore) to any provider. Reads and sync are unaffected."

#: config.html.twig
msgid ""
"Advanced: sync safety guard thresholds. Leave at the defaults unless you "
"understand exactly what they control — lowering them can cause normal syncs "
"to be refused, while raising them weakens protection against a mis-scoped "
"credential trashing DNS records."
msgstr ""
"Advanced: sync safety guard thresholds. Leave at the defaults unless you "
"understand exactly what they control — lowering them can cause normal syncs "
"to be refused, while raising them weakens protection against a mis-scoped "
"credential trashing DNS records."

#: config.html.twig
msgid "Max records trashed per sync"
msgstr "Max records trashed per sync"

#: config.html.twig
msgid ""
"A single synchronization is refused, and the domain left untouched, once it "
"would move more than this many records to the trash bin, or more than the "
"percentage below of the domain's currently-owned records — whichever is hit "
"first."
msgstr ""
"A single synchronization is refused, and the domain left untouched, once it "
"would move more than this many records to the trash bin, or more than the "
"percentage below of the domain's currently-owned records — whichever is hit "
"first."

